# Dev-only Bearer API key used to authenticate against the backend during local
# development, because OIDC is unconfigured by default (the backend's SSO login
# would 500) and the seeded super-admin authenticates via Bearer key only.
#
# Copy this file to `.env.development` and set the value to the backend's
# super-admin API key (see docker-compose.yaml). This is DEV-ONLY: the client
# injects it only when import.meta.env.DEV is true.
#
# VITE_DEV_API_KEY=super-admin-dev-key-do-not-use-in-production
